5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Before we rank the science, we must ask who is actually here to do the work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I agree! But I also wonder if the money we get actually buys the same things it used to.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Sakura"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Sakura**: I agree! But I also wonder if the money we get actually buys the same things it used to.""}]}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m not sure. I just want to know if our past guesses about what works have actually held up.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I’m worried about all the delays that happen before the science even starts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am concerned about the shared facilities and services that support all these projects.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your point about shrinking value is sharp. Let us look at the ledgers and the staffing rolls to see the truth.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I’ll check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, and the national computing agreement and facility day rates!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I’ll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I’ll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities, and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I’m all set! I’ll stick with my two choices. Let’s see what the numbers say!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll stick with my choices. I hope the records are clear enough to answer my questions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I’ll stick with my choices. I need to know exactly where the bottlenecks are before we commit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll stick with my choices. The current state of those services is the foundation we’re building on.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
